   221	**Why GNFS cannot do this.** By RES, a field sharing a root with a small rational side is either the special field
   222	or has log H_f ≥ (t − δ log‖f₀‖)/d (Lemma HR, §2). Fields with log H_f ≳ t/d obey (M1) and fall under Prop R2. So
