   497	  - Rigorous: the best α is 2/5 (Theorem U); constant ε_e^{2/5} for r^e ± 1 (Prop CY), o(1) along primorial e.
   498	- **Failure scope.**
   499	  - (O1) Fixed fields: HR/RS/PH/DI show that randomisation keeps the value set or costs height N^{1/d}.
   500	    RB: relativising supply proofs fail for any fixed family of N^{o(ν)} fields.
